    "description": "# BA-3: Restriction Detail Fields\n\n_Fields shown when a BA's status isn't Active — kept on BA, unlike the equivalent cut on Player._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Status Reason\n* Assignment Blocked\n* Status Notes\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* These fields stay — do not cut them the way Player's equivalent was cut\n\n* Joyce Kiddell, [52:33](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3153): \"I don't know why restriction detail shouldn't be there.\"\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-3 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-3 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 52:33 (fields stay)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3153)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
